# MoOS Nova — Plasma Style (desktoptheme) color stylesheet.
#
# This file is the runtime palette for Nova-owned SVGs and every SVG resolved
# through Plasma's fallback chain. The theme now ships identity glyphs plus
# original low-risk button/view-item FrameSvg states. Paths not yet overridden
# fall through Nova -> breeze-dark -> "default" (Breeze geometry) while keeping
# this Nova palette. VERIFIED against
# plasma/libplasma src/desktoptheme/breeze-dark (colors + metadata.json.cmake +
# plasmarc, no SVGs) and src/plasma/private/theme_p.cpp (setThemeName always
# appends "default" to fallbackThemes; findInTheme walks that chain). The
# FrameSvg state IDs are verified against libplasma v6.7.2.
#
# Palette is the MoOS Nova dark set, identical to /usr/share/color-schemes/
# NovaDark.colors so popups match the rest of the desktop. The notification /
# dialog / OSD panel background is [Colors:Window] BackgroundNormal = 17,26,46
# = #111A2E (Nova "surface"); translucency + blur come from the inherited Breeze
# translucent dialog SVG plus KWin blur (see /etc/xdg/kwinrc).

